{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/6e113368ad9ecf4f08bb.json":{"assets":{"ep2/quest_story_12223030":{"skip":{"source_cn":"看到你带回的热带鱼，莱诺曼非常高兴，连连向你道谢。","text_i18n":{"cn":"看到你带回的热带鱼，莱诺曼非常高兴，连连向你道谢。","en":"Leonor is overjoyed when you return with the tropical fish she needs. She thanks you profusely.","jp":"持ち帰った熱帯魚を見たレノマンはとても喜び、あなたに何度もお礼を言った。","kr":"내가 열대어를 가지고 돌아온 것을 본 르노르망은 매우 기뻐하며 연신 고맙다는 인사를 전했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["12223030"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["23671"]}}}},"catalogs/runtime/scenes/d5e0cdf6768d29d1e5cc.json":{"assets":{"ep2/quest_story_12223010":{"skip":{"source_cn":"莱诺曼被安排了搜集本地所有鱼类的任务，却没办法找到来自海岛的新鲜热带鱼，只能再次请你帮忙。","text_i18n":{"cn":"莱诺曼被安排了搜集本地所有鱼类的任务，却没办法找到来自海岛的新鲜热带鱼，只能再次请你帮忙。","en":"Leonor is asked to collect all local fish species, but she has no way to get hold of fresh tropical island fish. Once again, she seeks your help.","jp":"レノマンに課された任務は、現地の魚をすべて集めることだ。だが海島の新鮮な熱帯魚がなかなか手に入らず、彼女は再びあなたに手伝ってほしいと言った。","kr":"르노르망은 현지의 모든 물고기를 수집하라는 임무를 맡게 되었지만 섬에서 서식하는 열대어를 구할 수가 없었기에 다시금 나에게 도움을 청했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["12223010"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["23670"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep2/quest_story/12223010.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12223010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12223010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1222301001:1":{"text":"你好啊，莱诺曼！又出什么事了吗？你看起来好像很不高兴。","source_cn":"你好啊，莱诺曼！又出什么事了吗？你看起来好像很不高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC6F99C6CD02C6A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222301002:1":{"text":"别提了。我跟随的那位专家突发奇想，要写一篇锈锚港鱼类研究报告，让我去搜集本地所有鱼类。","source_cn":"别提了。我跟随的那位专家突发奇想，要写一篇锈锚港鱼类研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79BFBB8B41F917D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222301003:1":{"text":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出海，买也买不到，这不是刁难人吗……","source_cn":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7608A2E4EBA70EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1222301003":{"text":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出海，买也买不到，这不是刁难人吗……","source_cn":"——所有鱼类！包括生活在热带海岛上的那些！可我既不能出海，买也买不到，这不是刁难人吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7608A2E4EBA70EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222301004:1":{"text":"真的可以吗？那就多谢了！","source_cn":"真的可以吗？那就多谢了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD544CF258F9D6C3E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"真的可以吗？那就多谢了！","female":"真的可以吗？那就多谢了！","variant_male_record_index":"137311","variant_female_record_index":"137312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222301007:1":{"text":"和之前一样，这次专家也给了我一份鱼类清单。","source_cn":"和之前一样，这次专家也给了我一份鱼类清单。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58B6710E78441168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222301008:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">幻彩鲷</style>、<style=\"highlight\">珊瑚鲑</style>、<style=\"highlight\">日光鱼</style>，只要有这三种就足够了。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>幻彩鲷</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60E2FED5F9DB7A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222301009:1":{"text":"当然，依然得是<style=\"highlight\">新鲜的活鱼</style>才行！","source_cn":"当然，依然得是<style=highlight>新鲜的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2246559448FB7B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"我可以帮你留意一下","source_cn":"我可以帮你留意一下","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E26958CCB413F32","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我可以帮你留意一下","female":"我可以帮你留意一下","variant_male_record_index":"66878","variant_female_record_index":"66879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222301005:1":{"text":"呃，实话实说，协会还没招募到几个成员……","source_cn":"呃，实话实说，协会还没招募到几个成员……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC7DF22B1DBFB858","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222301006:1":{"text":"如果你们愿意帮忙的话，就再好不过了！","source_cn":"如果你们愿意帮忙的话，就再好不过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x234CA7896702C67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"钓鱼协会里的捕鱼人不肯帮你吗？","source_cn":"钓鱼协会里的捕鱼人不肯帮你吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB5964EA902B23BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_ke